  "player_hint_1_en": "Only one square fits both parts of Basil's clue (\"He was in the Vestry, but not beside a shelf.\"). So Basil (B) must be at row 8, column 6. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_2_en": "All of Harvey's squares are in column 2, so nobody else can use it. Celeste's own clue (\"She was in the Graveyard, but not beside a tree. She was exactly one row south of Harvey.\") rules out more squares. So Celeste (C) must be at row 2, column 3. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_3_en": "With the rows and columns of Basil and Celeste crossed out, only one square is left for Harvey that fits his clue (\"He was beside a tombstone.\"). So Harvey (H) must be at row 1, column 2. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_4_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Ezra that fits his clue (\"He was in a corner of his area.\"). So Ezra (E) must be at row 7, column 7. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_5_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Grace that fits her clue (\"She was standing in a puddle.\"). So Grace (G) must be at row 6, column 5. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_6_en": "Freya's clue (\"She was with a woman.\") needs the woman in Freya's area on a square that does not share her row or column; that rules out squares for Freya. The murderer must be in Valerie's area without sharing her row or column; that rules out squares for Valerie. Using the general clue (\"There was exactly one person beside a table.\"), some squares are ruled out for Dante. Dante is now the only person who can still go in column 1. So Dante (D) must be at row 4, column 1. Cross out his row and column.",
  "player_hint_7_en": "Only one square of column 4 is still open to anyone (row 5, column 4). Someone must stand there, so nobody else can use row 5. Freya's clue (\"She was with a woman.\") needs the woman in Freya's area on a square that does not share her row or column; that rules out squares for Freya. So Freya (F) must be at row 5, column 4. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_8_en": "The murderer must be in Valerie's area without sharing her row or column; that rules out squares for Valerie. So Valerie (the victim) must be at row 9, column 8. Cross out her row and column.",
  "player_hint_9_en": "With the rows and columns of everyone placed so far crossed out, only one square is left for Alma that fits her clue (\"She was exactly two columns east of Ezra.\"). So Alma (A) must be at row 3, column 9. Cross out her row and column. Basil is the only person in the Vestry with Valerie, so Basil is the murderer!"
 },
